# S-022 ProRes (QuickTime visual sample entry): the sample entry type is the encoder setting
# codec_type (a big-endian FourCC held in an int, here 'apch'); no stss, no avcC. Packets pass through
# unmodified. Includes MOV flavor (where this track type is normally used).
enc v video codec prores width 1920 height 1080 fps 30/1 id prores_ks codec_type 0x61706368 extra -
mux mov
pkt v 0 0 1 gen:30
pkt v 1 1 0 gen:31
pkt v 2 2 0 gen:32
finalise
dump
echo --- same in an MP4 file; codec_type 0 gives an entry named with four NUL bytes
reset
enc v video codec prores width 640 height 480 fps 30/1 codec_type 0
mux mp4 skipfin
pkt v 0 0 1 gen:30
finalise
tree
